# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in the values for the Supabase project tubewell-hisab.
# The app reads exactly these two variables (src/lib/config.ts); Netlify needs the same two.
# Both values are public by design (they ship in the browser bundle); RLS protects the data.
# Never put a service-role / secret key here or in any VITE_* variable.
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL: the project URL, https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY: the publishable key (starts with sb_publishable_)
# Where to copy them from in the Supabase dashboard: docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
